    "- Upload video `IE_Challenge_lat43_521955_lon5_624290.MP4` to `My Drive/capstone-dronomy/`\n",
    "- Upload your `.env` file to `My Drive/capstone-dronomy/.env`\n",
    "\n",
    "Frame extraction happens automatically in Cell 0b on first run (~5 min). Subsequent runs reuse extracted frames."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
