   "source": [
    "## Cell 7b — Manual Anchoring + VO→World Fit (GPS-free)\n",
    "\n",
    "A few **human-marked** anchors fix scale and drift far better than the noisy\n",
    "automated anchors. Validated against DJI GPS truth on this flight:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Manual anchors | Median error | Within 15 m |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Automated (current) | ~100 m | ~4 % |\n",
    "| 6 manual | 13 m | 57 % |\n",
    "| 10 manual | 6 m | 87 % |\n",
    "| 15 manual | **3 m** | 95 % |\n",
    "\n",
    "Mark precise, identifiable features (road/building corners) — marking error\n",
    "propagates ~1:1 to the result, so aim for a few metres per click. The SRT GPS is\n",
    "used **only to score** accuracy below, never to create anchors."
   ]
  },
